COINKITE


IMPORTANT SECURITY ADVISORY FOR YOUR COLDCARD

We are reaching out to all COLDCARD users regarding a serious security matter. Whether or not your account was affected, we ask that you schedule a 10-minute call with our team via Calendly so we can walk you through the details, answer your questions, and confirm the safety of your setup.

If you were identified as an affected user, this call will also cover the next steps to register for the refund process.

Schedule your 10-minute call https://book.coinkiteadvisory.com/

Affected users can also begin the refund registration during the call. Please book a time as soon as possible so we can support you directly.

----------------------------------------


A REMINDER: COINKITE WILL NEVER ASK FOR

 * Your PIN code, your seed phrase, or any part of it.

 * You to sign a PSBT transaction with your Coldcard.

 * KYC data, beyond the minimum needed for shipping.

If anyone claiming to be from Coinkite asks for any of the above, it is not us. Please disregard the message and reach out to our team directly.

Thank you for your trust and vigilance.

The Coinkite Team
